OL,2,V55555555CN-TRIGGERS: IRAQI
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CDEPORTED FROM BRITAIN
OL,4,T
OL,5, An Iraqi thought to have masterminded
OL,6, an alleged plot to smuggle nuclear
OL,7, triggers to Baghdad has been deported
OL,8, from Britain.
OL,10, Omar Latif, who said he was an official
OL,11, of Iraqi Airways, was escorted aboard
OL,12, a Baghdad-bound jumbo jet at Heathrow
OL,13, by police and immigration officials.
OL,15, Three people, a Lebanese engineer, a
OL,16, man with British-Iraqi citizenship and
OL,17, a French woman, have been charged with
OL,18, trying to smuggle the triggers to Iraq.
OL,20, Latif was arrested by police on
OL,21, Wednesday but no charges were brought.
OL,23,F]DFrom 31-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
