OL,2,V55555555CANC POSTPONES TALKS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CWITH S AFRICA GOVT
OL,4,T
OL,5, The ANC has postponed indefinitely
OL,6, talks with the South African government
OL,7, in protest against the police shooting
OL,8, of demonstrators at a black township.
OL,10, It added that the government should
OL,11, take action against the police who were
OL,12, establishing a pattern of "brutality
OL,13, and repression".
OL,15, At least 11 people died after police
OL,16, opened fire in the Sebokeng on Monday.
OL,18, The April 11 talks would have been the
OL,19, first step towards negotiations between
OL,20, the white minority government and the
OL,21, black nationalist movement.
OL,23,F]DFrom 31-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
